## 1. GITFLOW BRANCHING IS MANDATORY
- NEVER commit directly to `master`.
- ALWAYS create a feature branch off `develop`:
    git checkout develop
    git pull origin develop
    git checkout -b feature/<feature-name> develop
- For production hotfixes:
    git checkout master
    git checkout -b hotfix/<issue-name> master
    Fix, test, then merge --no-ff to master (tag vX.Y) AND merge --no-ff to develop.
- Always use `git merge --no-ff` so merge commits are explicitly recorded in the graph.

## 2. PRE-MERGE VERIFICATION (QUALITY GATE)
Before merging ANY branch, you MUST run and confirm:
1. `npm run test:unit --prefix Backend` -> 100% tests must pass.
2. `npm run db:test` -> 20/20 standard tables synchronized.
3. `npm run build --prefix FrontEnd` -> clean build without errors.

See GIT_WORKFLOW_RULES.md for complete details.
